      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1752796800000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE MECHANISM MATCH\nConsistent hashing's whole guarantee is \"one key maps to one host, deterministically, at any pool size.\" That's exactly\nwhat makes horizontal scaling free for ordinary keys — and exactly why it's powerless against one key that's hot enough\non its own: more hosts just relocates the same single point of saturation. Cache smearing doesn't touch the hash\nfunction at all. It multiplies the keys feeding into it — the routing rule wasn't broken, it just needed more keys.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "b_mech",
      "originalText": "THE MECHANISM MATCH\nConsistent hashing's whole guarantee is \"one key maps to one host, deterministically, at any pool size.\" That's exactly\nwhat makes horizontal scaling free for ordinary keys — and exactly why it's powerless against one key that's hot enough\non its own: more hosts just relocates the same single point of saturation. Cache smearing doesn't touch the hash\nfunction at all. It multiplies the keys feeding into it — the routing rule wasn't broken, it just needed more keys.",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "e_footnote",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 615,
      "width": 1140,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#555555",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1752796800000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The tradeoff didn't disappear — it moved. Smearing is manual, applied by hand to whatever mctop flags, not a default.\nWrites now touch every smeared copy, so two clients reading different smeared variants of the same logical key can\nbriefly see different values. Etsy spent a little consistency to buy back bandwidth.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The tradeoff didn't disappear — it moved. Smearing is manual, applied by hand to whatever mctop flags, not a default.\nWrites now touch every smeared copy, so two clients reading different smeared variants of the same logical key can\nbriefly see different values. Etsy spent a little consistency to buy back bandwidth.",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    }
  ],
